msgid "⟪k:0⟫but I ⟪k:1⟫was⟪k:2⟫ able to uncover the truth."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫mas eu ⟪k:1⟫fui⟪k:2⟫ capaz de descobrir a verdade."

