msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫should⟪k:2⟫ be enough to change her heart..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫deve⟪k:2⟫ ser o suficiente para mudar seu coração..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_856665BF_C630_4CA9_AE54_B340A95F78B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 815249ce4ac6340e5ece0370b5e2bbb6a216b8305ead06d98a0f97646a3ddb63
#. default-sha256: 8ea1797c5581d5627b2ea130e6d3a849ec6e3f28de2b4a016847427e3bcf39fa
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_856665BF_C630_4CA9_AE54_B340A95F78B2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and change the course of their next lives."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫e mudar o curso de suas próximas vidas."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F92CB0CC_84A8_4080_A3E0_B5194806340E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 392c4775e6543d66cd06b4998f0448d0d252b6eea73e4d1c48301752dfe51458
#. default-sha256: 31ece873cbfbd7236d1e8d8f904b2c9d6a8e3d9a83cbed16b8e0c4847e1e4765
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F92CB0CC_84A8_4080_A3E0_B5194806340E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They should be able to avoid the tragedies I witnessed through each of their doors."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eles devem ser capazes de evitar as tragédias que testemunhei através de cada uma de suas "
"portas."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F93A566A_BD29_44BD_BE2A_8ED6A23FA60F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 62d4eaab5cfe7592c3200707c12631bc88c11b6c20e0dda832787e397f4d8921
#. default-sha256: f35b0f3aafd0fa41013b51853c1f24778fca3cb8e93acda924180e1c639258fb
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F93A566A_BD29_44BD_BE2A_8ED6A23FA60F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫When we step through this door and people see Morgana’s body,⟪k:5⟫we’ll "
"be made to pay for our sins."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Quando passarmos por esta porta e as pessoas verem o corpo de Morgana,"
"⟪k:5⟫seremos obrigados a pagar pelos nossos pecados."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4E429D64_4256_4431_AEE5_082107636ABC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bcc7e73f1a8e69d07089c9caa53603a3da1e9946228eef2dfcfb6db89479cd61
#. default-sha256: 34810285011288b4cae33dd5b555b0dda4bece732f8204b9d86e2482fae479a2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4E429D64_4256_4431_AEE5_082107636ABC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ultimately, I’m the one responsible,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫so the two of you are welcome to "
"stay behind..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Em última análise, eu sou o único responsável,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫então vocês dois são bem-"
"vindos para ficar para trás..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_A6C300C5_C8C4_4A4F_95DA_668A7568FA32
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7f91fc311eb6865bc45c82a5848c99616be64e455ba09c7cf991a2756b66e0bf
#. default-sha256: 88ec425698c3b65612a1db234909b0a003984884782a2b965247e12ee11f7f0c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A6C300C5_C8C4_4A4F_95DA_668A7568FA32"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m coming with you.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫A girl died because of the things I did...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"I can’t just pretend it didn’t have anything to do with me..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu vou com você.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Uma garota morreu por causa das coisas que eu fiz...⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫Não posso simplesmente fingir que não teve nada a ver comigo..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3D6F1818_603A_4F36_83E6_C18293AF930E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b69c583917c9976f9195909018119ae5b552f52af98c732cba3b031d12d3b0d
#. default-sha256: fa186a2c43b8b98cfb8c86933d6f89ef421dda53af79b07ae561353f220af4da
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3D6F1818_603A_4F36_83E6_C18293AF930E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No, I don’t ⟪k:2⟫want⟪k:3⟫ to."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Não, eu não ⟪k:2⟫quero⟪k:3⟫."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0EC45386_CC26_4273_9642_877D8503B806
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 077ac518dd022408b7492b45e58621256db8e4fd17484ce858d5cb960cafa986
