#: scenario8:scenario8_0357EF2B_3EF5_4C3A_BAC0_D828E0C3AB1A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cef23f9a0686b4013aea00b3ba175fbda500dfe87e1fe8f000415fa2353b61ef
