msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You always had the courage within you, Mell.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫You simply needed a "
"little help finding it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Você sempre teve a coragem dentro de você, Mell.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Só precisava de uma "
"ajudinha para encontrá-la."

#: scenario8:scenario8_8083C7A0_A13C_418B_BA18_0C5A13DB5AA0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 35ecdad898056625e99da1654efc65699500c96b3d52cb26136a7980bb506c12
#. default-sha256: db43f5b4a013f5fa00b701729f0ba47bd80eaa67bec8a09510011f975582558d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8083C7A0_A13C_418B_BA18_0C5A13DB5AA0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It wasn’t my strength that allowed you to take action,⟪k:1⟫but your own."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Não foi a minha força que permitiu que você agisse,⟪k:1⟫mas a sua própria."

#: scenario8:scenario8_473582DE_B5DC_4205_8803_8FB0FCD38B8E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc189442eb6c2686837a485f207dffb69fbe44b14e1430e0114b65b92385fd39
#. default-sha256: 0b52c7c8bcf852fbf37495d6f9c196411f2b7903cd81ced38cc9a818ed999bf6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_473582DE_B5DC_4205_8803_8FB0FCD38B8E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Haha... ⟪k:3⟫you sure know how to make someone feel better about themselves."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Haha... ⟪k:3⟫você certamente sabe como fazer alguém se sentir melhor consigo mesmo."

